{"timestamp": 1779356385.205999, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 11, "data": {"caller": "player_4", "reason": "Eve reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "medbay", "victim_name": "Frank"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779356385.206308, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 11, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779356392.9871643, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I found Frank dead in Medbay. I had just come down from Cafeteria to do my scan, and Charlie walked in from Electrical at the exact same moment. I reported it instantly. Charlie, you can vouch for me reporting it right as we both walked in, right? Did you see anyone running away through Electrical or somewhere else before you got to Medbay?"}}
{"timestamp": 1779356400.9541934, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I started in Cafeteria, passed through Medbay, and ended up down in Storage. I didn't see Frank or anyone else when I walked through Medbay, so the kill definitely happened after I headed south to Storage. I haven't bumped into anyone else this round. Let's hear what Charlie has to say about Eve's story, but at least we have a rough timeframe now."}}
{"timestamp": 1779356410.8353603, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I started in Electrical, then moved to Security and finally up to Weapons. I actually saw Charlie enter Security from Navigation really early on, and we were in Security together for a few ticks. If Charlie headed left through Electrical and into Medbay after that, it completely lines up with Eve's story about him arriving from the Electrical side. I haven't seen Frank or anyone else though. Let's hear what Charlie and Bob have to add to the timeline."}}
{"timestamp": 1779356493.7070935, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I was completely on the left side of the map this whole round. I started in Oxygen, moved down to Upper Engine, and then to Lower Engine where I was doing my fuel task. I haven't seen a single person all round, so I can't vouch for anyone, but my path means the killer definitely didn't flee to the left side of the ship. \n\nSince Diana was in Storage, Eve came from Cafeteria, and Charlie came from Electrical, the killer would have had a hard time leaving Medbay without running into one of you, unless they vented or one of the stories here is a lie. Charlie, let's hear if you actually saw Eve walk in at the same time as you, and if you saw anyone else on your way through Electrical. I think I'll be skipping this vote unless Charlie drops a bombshell, since it's too early and it's basically he-said-she-said in the middle right now."}}
{"timestamp": 1779356514.786613, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I can 100% confirm Alice's timeline. I started in Navigation, moved up to Security, and saw Alice enter Security from Electrical around tick 3. We hung out there for a bit, and she left towards Weapons around tick 6. Alice is totally clear in my book. \n\nAfter that, I walked through Electrical and into Medbay. Eve is telling the truth about the timing\u2014the report happened the exact second I stepped foot in Medbay. However, to answer Eve's question: I didn't see *anyone* running away through Electrical. It was completely empty after Alice had left earlier.\n\nSo let's put this together: I saw no one fleeing into Electrical. Bob saw no one fleeing to the left side (Engines/Oxygen). That means the killer either fled into Cafeteria, went down to Storage (which points to Diana), vented, OR Eve panicked and self-reported the exact moment she saw me walk into Medbay so I wouldn't catch her red-handed. \n\nRight now, the suspect pool is really narrow\u2014it's most likely between Eve (if it's a self-report) or Diana (if she killed Frank on her way to Storage and lied about Medbay being empty). Since there's only 1 Duck, we don't need to risk a 50/50 guess today. I say we skip, but keep a very close eye on Eve and Diana next round."}}
